;;;; Bangladesh — public holidays of government offices, one block per year:
;;;; the yearly holiday list (ছুটির তালিকা) with its amendments and Eid notices.
;;;; :holidays are the general (সাধারণ ছুটি, :kind :general) and executive-order
;;;; (নির্বাহী আদেশে ছুটি, :kind :executive) days at their final dates, each
;;;; citing the document that set it; optional holidays and days for one region
;;;; (Chaitra Sankranti in the three hill districts) are left out. :suppressed
;;;; are rule days a notice cancelled; :working are Saturdays a notice made
;;;; working days. 2013-2027 :primary (Ministry of Public Administration lists
;;;; and notices, mopa.gov.bd); 2002-2008 and 2010-2012 :secondary (the
;;;; bank-holiday lists Bangladesh Bank circulated, and news), with the
;;;; general/executive split inferred. 2000, 2001 and 2009 have no list. Every
;;;; block and row carries :issued and :published (#93). Read by
;;;; bangladesh-holidays-calendar (src/starter-south-asia.lisp).

